{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261103/photo/bkn-20261103211029675-1103_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261103214706\"/><p>今午(3日)4時42分，將軍澳怡明邨怡悅樓保安員報案，指上址一單位傳出異味，懷疑姓梁(54歲)在屋內暈倒。警員接報到場，發現梁男已在屋內死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:22:14.764668+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:10:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T14:59:17.602196+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:18:30.833934+00:00","content_hash":"f2cee59350d5eb0b829dd54277ea20c9bc48d1428d0b9839409fbf8d04b4cb6f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}